### Verifying the download

PowerShell:

```
Get-FileHash {{ (h.zip_asset or h.exe_asset).name }} -Algorithm SHA256
```

macOS / Linux:

```
shasum -a 256 {{ (h.zip_asset or h.exe_asset).name }}
```

Compare the output against the SHA-256 value shown above.

